{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060874/block/singleImage/3251738/wm/01M5GCWZ19JF8J2JX2E934FAF0.jpg?updatedAt=1793240087\"/><figcaption>本港地區今日天氣預測，漸轉天晴及乾燥。吹和緩至清勁東風，最低25度，最高29度(蘇文傑攝/資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>天文台今日(29日)稱，現時影響廣東沿岸的東北季候風正逐漸緩和。本港地區今日天氣預測，漸轉天晴及乾燥。吹和緩至清勁東風，最低25度，最高29度。展望未來一兩日日間大致天晴及乾燥。星期日雲量增多。 隨著東北季候風逐漸緩和及高空反氣旋增強，今明兩日廣東天色普遍晴朗。預料一股偏東氣流會在週末期間影響華南沿岸，該區雲量逐漸增多。另一股東北季候風會在下週初至中期影響華南</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-10/1060874/block/singleImage/3251740/df/01M62PY9CMDWK5GJFKXNQYD38K.png?updatedAt=1793240087\"/><figcaption>天文台九天天氣預報</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.705825+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":242,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:14:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T12:38:14.751089+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:38:25.501385+00:00","content_hash":"56ea22e3ac353f3620e75c71d5f439f887ffc0fd38bfa990a4a6f53e938c7f63","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:42:01.705825+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}